{"version":1,"slug":"Others__INEQUALITY_(4)","path":"Others/INEQUALITY (4).html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Others","category":"INEQUALITY (4).html","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In this question, the statement is followed by three conclusions. Which of the two conclusion(s) is/are true?</p><p>Statement:</p><p>d &gt; h = s &ge; m = n &ge; x &gt; c = v</p><p>Conclusions:</p><p>I: m &gt; v</p><p>II: x &le; d</p><p>III: c &gt; h</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2311;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366;/&#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;/&#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;:</p><p>d &gt; h = s &ge; m = n &ge; x &gt; c = v</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;:</p><p>I: m &gt; v</p><p>II: x &le; d</p><p>III: c &gt; h</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion I is true<b> </b></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion III is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#232