#2352;&#2381;&#2325;&#2367;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">B</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">B</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">E</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">E</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">C</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">C</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Here, </p><p>Rational means do not follow and logical means follow. </p><p>w &gt; k = a &ge; x = n &lt; v &le; b = h</p><p>Conclusion:</p><p>i) h &gt; x; x = n &lt; v &le; b = h ------ logical</p><p>ii) n &lt; w; w &gt; k = a &ge; x = n ------ logical</p><p>So, i and ii are both logical. </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In this question, there are two statements showing the relation, followed by three conclusions i, ii and iii. Assuming that the given story is true, find out which conclusion is definitely true. </p><p>Statement:</p><p>E &gt; K = S; J &lt; D = S ; J &gt; G &ge; V</p><p>Conclusion:</p><p>i) V &lt; E</p><p>ii) D = K</p><p>iii) G &le; S</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2311;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2342;&#2379; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; i, ii &#2324;&#2352; iii &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2351;&#2361; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2369;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2325;&#2361;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2346;&#2340;&#2366; &#2354;&#2327;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2325;&#2367; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;:</p><p>E &gt; K = S; J &lt; D = S; J &gt; G &ge; V</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;:</p><p>i) V &lt; E</p><p>ii) D = K</p><p>iii) G &le; S</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Only i and ii</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; i &#2324;&#2352; ii</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only ii and iii</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; ii &#2324;&#2352; iii</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only i and iii</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; i &#2324;&#2352; iii</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">All follow</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>E &gt; K = S; J &lt; D = S ; J &gt; G &ge; V which is E &gt; K = S = D &gt; J &gt; G &ge; V</p><p>i) V &lt; E ; E &gt; K = S = D &gt; J &gt; G &ge; V ----- Follow</p><p>ii) D = K; K = S = D --- Follow</p><p>iii) G &le; S; S = D &gt; J &gt; G --- does not follow</p><p>So, Only i and ii follow</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In which of the following, B <u>&gt;</u> C is definitely true?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; B <u>&gt;</u> C &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">A = C <u>&gt;</u> D &lt; B <u>&gt;</u> G</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A = C <u>&gt;</u> D &lt; B <u>&gt;</u> G</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">B &gt; P = C <u>&gt;</u> Q &lt; R = G</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">B &gt; P = C <u>&gt;</u> Q &lt; R = G</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">B = D <u>&lt;</u> A = C &lt; D</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">B = D <u>&lt;</u> A = C &lt; D</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">C <u>&lt;</u> D = A <u>&lt;</u> B &gt; D</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">C <u>&lt;</u> D = A <u>&lt;</u> B &gt; D</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Option 1: - A = C <u>&gt;</u> D &lt; B <u>&gt;</u> G</p><p>We cannot compare B and C. So, option 1 is incorrect.</p><p>Option 2: - B &gt; P = C <u>&gt;</u> Q &lt; R = G</p><p>B &gt; C. So, option 2 is incorrect.</p><p>Option 3: - B = D <u>&lt;</u> A = C &lt; D</p><p>B <u>&lt;</u> C, so option 3 is incorrect.</p><p>Option 4: - <b>C <u>&lt;</u> D = A <u>&lt;</u> B</b> &gt; D</p><p>Here, <b>C <u>&lt;</u> B</b>. So, this is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If the expressions 'E &lt; J &le; H &gt; Z', 'H &le;Y' and 'E &gt; F' are true, which of the following conclusions will be definitely false?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; 'E &lt; J &le; H &gt; Z', 'H &le;Y' &#2324;&#2352; 'E &gt; F' &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2309;&#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">F&lt;Y</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">F&lt;Y</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Y&gt;E</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Y&gt;E</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">F&lt;H</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">F&lt;H</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">None of these</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2311;&#2344;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2379;&#2312; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306;</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Combining the given expressions,</p><p></p><p>F &lt; E &lt; J &le; H &le; Y and Z &lt; H</p><p></p><p>Considering the above expression</p><p></p><p>Option 1 is true</p><p></p><p>Option 2 is true</p><p></p><p>Option 3 is true</p><p></p><p>Hence none of the options is definitely false.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the question below, a statement is followed by two conclusions based on the statement. Study the conclusions and select the correct option as the answer. </p><p><b>Statement: </b></p><p>A &gt; T &ge; L &ge; M = P; H &ge; L</p><p><b>Conclusions:</b></p><p>I. H &gt; A</p><p>II. A &gt; M</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2342;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p><b>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344; : </b></p><p>A &gt; T &ge; L &ge; M = P; H &ge; L</p><p><b>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; :</b></p><p>I. H &gt; A</p><p>II. A &gt; M</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Only I is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Either I or II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2351;&#2366; &#2340;&#2379; I &#2351;&#2366; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Neither I nor II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344; &#2340;&#2379; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Here, the given statement is: A &gt; T &ge; L &ge; M = P; H &ge; L</p><p>A &gt; T &ge; L &le; H. Here, the definite relation between H and A cannot be determined. So, conclusion I is false. </p><p>A &gt; T &ge; L &ge; M. Here, A &gt; M. So, conclusion II is true. </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the question, assuming the given statements to be true, find which of the conclusions among the given two conclusions is/are definitely true, and then give your answer according to it. </p><p><b>Statement:</b></p><p>L &le; Y; L = C &ge; K</p><p><b>Conclusions:</b></p><p>I. K &gt; L</p><p>II. K &lt; Y</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2369;&#2319; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2342;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366;/&#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;/&#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2366;&#2352; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2366; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2342;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p><b>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344; :</b></p><p>L &le; Y; L = C &ge; K</p><p><b>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; :</b></p><p>I. K &gt; L</p><p>II. K &lt; Y</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Only I follows</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only II follows</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; II &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Both I and II follow</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Neither I nor II follow</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344; &#2340;&#2379; I &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; II &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>It is given that,</p><p>L &le; Y; L = C &ge; K</p><p>We get,</p><p>Y &ge; L = C &ge; K</p><p>I. K &gt; L does not follow as Y &ge; <b>L = C &ge; K </b>and L &ge; K<b>.</b></p><p>II. K &lt; Y does not follow as <b>Y &ge; L = C &ge; K </b>and Y &ge; K<b>.</b></p><p>Hence, option <b>(d) </b>is correct.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the question below, a statement is followed by two conclusions based on the statement. Study the conclusions and select the correct option as the answer.</p><p>Statement: A &gt; G &ge; I; J &lt; C &le; K &gt; E; L &gt; C &le; A</p><p>Conclusion I: J &lt; A</p><p>Conclusion II: L &gt; I</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2342;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;: A &gt; G &ge; I; J &lt; C &le; K &gt; E; L &gt; C &le; A</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I: J &lt; A</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II: L &gt; I</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Only I follows</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Both I and II follow</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Either I or II follow</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2351;&#2366; &#2340;&#2379; I &#2351;&#2366; II &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only II follows</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; II &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Given statement is A &gt; G &ge; I; J &lt; C &le; K &gt; E; L &gt; C &le; A</p><p>J &lt; C &le; A</p><p>J &lt; A</p><p>So conclusion I follows.</p><p>L &gt; C &le; A &gt; G &ge; I</p><p>So conclusion II does not follows.</p><p>Thus, Only conclusion I follow</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If T = H &lt; O, S &gt; K &gt; N, S &gt; O, M &gt; S, then which of the following expressions is not correct?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; T = H &lt; O, S &gt; K &gt; N, S &gt; O, M &gt; S &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">M &gt; H</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">M &gt; H</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">S &gt; T</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">S &gt; T</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">M &lt; N</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">M &lt; N</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">O &gt; T</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">O &gt; T</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>T = H &lt; O, S &gt; K &gt; N, S &gt; O, M &gt; S</p><p>So, T = H &lt; O &lt; S &lt; M</p><p>And, N &lt; K &lt; S &lt; M</p><p>So, M &lt; N is not correct.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Read the given statement and conclusions carefully. Decide which of the given conclusions is/are definitely true from the statement. </p><p><b>Statement: </b>Y &ge; T &le; U = B &lt; G </p><p><b>Conclusion I: </b>Y &lt; U</p><p><b>Conclusion II: </b>G &gt; T</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2379; &#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2344;&#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357;&#2325; &#2346;&#2338;&#2364;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366;/&#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;/&#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p><b>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;: </b>Y &ge; T &le; U = B &lt; G</p><p><b>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I: </b>Y &lt; U</p><p><b>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II: </b>G &gt; T</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion I is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Both conclusion I and conclusion II are true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Neither conclusion I nor conclusion II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344; &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>It is given that, </p><p>Y &ge; T &le; U = B &lt; G </p><p><b>Conclusion I: </b>Y &lt; U does not follow as the relationship between Y and U cannot be determined. </p><p><b>Conclusion II: </b>G &gt; T follows as Y &ge; <b>T &le; U = B &lt; G.</b> </p><p>Hence, option<b> (a) </b>is correct. </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the following question, the statement is followed by two conclusions. Which of the two conclusions is/are true?</p><p>Statement: A &lt; Q &ge; L = C &ge; X = I &le; V</p><p>Conclusions:</p><p>I. I &lt; Q</p><p>II. I = Q</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2342;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366;/&#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;/&#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344; : A &lt; Q &ge; L = C &ge; X = I &le; V</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; :</p><p>I. I &lt; Q</p><p>II. I = Q</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Both conclusions I and II are true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Either conclusion I or conclusion II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2351;&#2366; &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2351;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusions I is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Given statement is A &lt; Q &ge; L = C &ge; X = I &le; V</p><p>Q &ge; L = C &ge; X = I </p><p>Here the common sign between I and Q is '&le;'.</p><p>Hence, I &le; Q</p><p>So, either I &lt; Q or I = Q.</p><p>Thus, either conclusion I or conclusion II is true.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the following question, the statement is followed by two conclusions. Which of the two conclusions is/are true?</p><p>Statement: K = R &le; E &lt; Z = V &gt; G &ge; T</p><p>Conclusions:</p><p>I. V &gt; K</p><p>II. T &lt; Z</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2342;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366;/&#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;/&#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;: K = R &le; E &lt; Z = V &gt; G &ge; T</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;:</p><p>I. V &gt; K</p><p>II. T &lt; Z</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Both conclusions I and II are true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Neither conclusion I nor II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344; &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion I is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Given statement is K = R &le; E &lt; Z = V &gt; G &ge; T</p><p>K = R &le; E &lt; Z = V. So, conclusion I is true.</p><p>Z = V &gt; G &ge; T. So, conclusion II is true.</p><p>Thus, both conclusions I and II are true.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the question below, a statement is followed by two conclusions based on the statement. Study the conclusions and select the correct option as the answer.</p><p>Statement: A &gt; O = G &le; T = Z &lt; K &ge; V</p><p>Conclusion I: A &gt; Z</p><p>Conclusion II: O &ge; V</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2342;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;: A &gt; O = G &le; T = Z &lt; K &ge; V</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I: A &gt; Z</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II: O &ge; V</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Only I follows</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Neither I nor II follows</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344; &#2340;&#2379; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; II &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only II follows</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; II &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Both I and II follow</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Given statement is A &gt; O = G &le; T = Z &lt; K &ge; V</p><p>A &gt; O = G &le; T = Z </p><p>So, conclusion I does not follows.</p><p>O = G &le; T = Z &lt; K &ge; V </p><p>So, conclusion II does not follows.</p><p>Thus, neither conclusion I nor conclusion II follows.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the following question, a statement is followed by two conclusions. Assuming the given statement to be true, find which of the conclusion(s) is/are true and then give your answer accordingly.</p><p><b>Statement: </b>N &le; M &lt; J; K &ge; J &lt; P</p><p><b>Conclusions:</b> </p><p>I. N &lt; P</p><p>II. K &ge; M</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2342;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2369;&#2319;, &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;/&#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2366;&#2352; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2366; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2342;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p><b>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;: </b>N &le; M &lt; J; K &ge; J &lt; P</p><p><b>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;:</b></p><p>I. N &lt; P</p><p>II. K &ge; M</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion I follows</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Neither conclusion I nor II follows</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344; &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; II &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Both conclusion I and II follow</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion II follows</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>The given statement is: N &le; M &lt; J; K &ge; J &lt; P</p><p>N &le; M &lt; J &lt; P. Here, P &gt; N. So, conclusion I is true. </p><p>M &lt; J &le; K. Here, K &gt; M. So, conclusion II is false. </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If M&ge;T&ge;R, J&gt;B,L=D, B&gt;D then which of the following relations will be definitely false?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; M&ge;T&ge;R, J&gt;B, L=D, B&gt;D &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2309;&#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">B &gt; L</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">B &gt; L</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">M = R</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">M = R</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">T &gt; L</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">T &gt; L</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">J &gt; D</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">J &gt; D</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>We have:</p><p>M&ge;T&ge;R, J&gt;B,L=D, B&gt;D</p><p>So B &gt; L is true</p><p>M = R is true</p><p>T &gt; L is false</p><p>J &gt; D is true</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If A = G &ge; T = E &lt; B &le; R and N &gt; I &le; S = V &gt; Q, then which of the following is not correct ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A = G &ge; T = E &lt; B &le; R &#2324;&#2352; N &gt; I &le; S = V &gt; Q &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">A &ge; E</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A &ge; E</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">T &le; R</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">T &le; R</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">I &le; V</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">I &le; V</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">B &gt; T</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">B &gt; T</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>It is given that,</p><p>A = G &ge; T = E &lt; B &le; R........(1)</p><p>N &gt; I &le; S = V &gt; Q............(2)</p><p>From (1),</p><p>T &lt; R.</p><p>Option (b) is not correct.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><b>Which of the following symbols should be placed in the blank spaces from left to right respectively in order to complete the given expression in such a manner that M&gt;A is definitely true?</b></p><p>M&gt;Q_T, R_A&lt;B&lt;S, T_R</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><b>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; &#2348;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2360;&#2375; &#2342;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2352;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2311;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2352;&#2326;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367; </b><b>M&gt;A &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2379;?</b></p><p>M&gt;Q_T, R_A&lt;B&lt;S, T_R</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">&lt;, =, <u>&lt;</u></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&lt;, =, <u>&lt;</u></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&gt;, &lt;, <u>&lt;</u></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&gt;, &lt;, <u>&lt;</u></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&gt;, &gt;, <u>&gt;</u></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&gt;, &gt;, <u>&gt;</u></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&lt;, &lt;, =</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&lt;, &lt;, =</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>By option 3,</p><p>M&gt;Q&gt;T, R&gt;A&lt;B&lt;S, T<u>&gt;</u>R</p><p>M&gt;Q&gt;T<u>&gt;</u>R&gt;A&lt;B&lt;S</p><p>Clearly M&gt;A it true.</p><p>By using any other option, we cannot compare M and A.</p><p>Hence, option 3.</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}